%U A398290 204317382758703012,5490364932224344260,148266190747992137796,4021198373378964870486,109475665104963222114372
%N A398290 Diagonal of rational function 1/(1 - (1 + x*y*z)*(x + y) - z).
%C A398290 For integers s >= 1, t >= 0 and e_1, ... ,e_s >= 0 with e_1 + ... + e_s = t, [x_1^n*  ... *x_s^n] 1/(1 - Sum_{i=1..s} x_i * (1 + x_1* ... *x_s)^e_i) = Sum_{k=0..n} (s*k)!/k!^s * binomial(t*k,n-k). For s=3, t=2, (e_1,e_2,e_3)=(1,1,0), and (x_1,x_2,x_3)=(x,y,z), this gives a(n) = [x^n*y^n*z^n] 1/(1 - (1 + x*y*z)*(x + y) - z).
%F A398290 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} (3*k)!/k!^3 * binomial(2*k,n-k).
%o A398290 (PARI) a(n, s=3, t=2) = sum(k=0, n, (s*k)!/k!^s*binomial(t*k, n-k));
%Y A398290 Cf. A002478, A137635, A398293.
%Y A398290 Cf. A361728, A361737, A398291.
